<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Last updated: July 27, 2026. How StackedTools handles your data, cookies, and privacy rights."
>
  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to StackedTools ("we," "our," or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and share information when you visit <strong>stacked-tools.vercel.app</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    We collect minimal information to ensure a seamless experience on our website:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Log & Analytics Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and page visit duration via Google Analytics 4.</li>
    <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> Standard HTTP cookies used by Google AdSense and analytics tools.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Information you voluntarily provide via our contact form (e.g., name, email address).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Use of Google AdSense & Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    StackedTools uses Google AdSense to serve advertisements. Google uses cookies (including the DoubleClick cookie) to serve ads based on your visit to this and other websites on the internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    StackedTools participates in various affiliate marketing programs. This means we may earn a commission on purchases made through links to retailer sites. This comes at no additional cost to you and does not influence our editorial independence.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights (GDPR & CCPA)</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on your location, you have the right to access, rectify, or erase your personal data held by us. To exercise these rights, please contact us via our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
